# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/
/.idea
/log
.DS_Store
/.DS_Store
*/.DS_Store
*/*/.DS_Store
/home
.*
!.gitignore
!.harness
# `.*` 会顺手吃掉这两个：它们只有形状、没有值，必须入库
!.dockerignore
!.env.example
package-lock.json
# 本地产物（go build -o main .）；镜像里的编译在容器里做，见 Dockerfile 的 build 段
/main